      "writtenOn": "2026-06-11T15:48:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If we generalized to the usage mask, then I think `findOrCreateTexture` and the ResourceCache APIs would just take in a label and a usage flag bitmask. Then we wouldn\u0027t have to worry about keeping the custom label vs. usage-flag cases separate since we\u0027d just string concat the two together.  A benefit here is that we aren\u0027t then splitting the texture pool up (if we have these new resource types we\u0027ll lose the ability to recycle a non-shareable texture into a scratch texture).",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 109,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 112,
        "endChar": 82
      },
      "revId": "0add26adaf485ad41ed1ef6cc2f9bf11af2252d3",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
